# What GitHub counts as this repository's language.
#
# The pilot page, its stylesheet, its fonts and the pilot list are copied in
# from the website by sync-web.sh (a cp, not a build step), so they are
# third-party to this repo: vendored, and left out of the language bar. What is
# written here is the Swift, bridge.js and the tools.
IMPKT/Resources/Web/**     linguist-vendored
IMPKT/Resources/css/**     linguist-vendored
IMPKT/Resources/fonts/**   linguist-vendored
IMPKT/Resources/pilots.json linguist-vendored

# HTML mirrors of the SwiftUI tabs, drawn by hand for tools/preview.py so the
# screens can be looked at in a browser. Development aids, not app code.
tools/preview-tabs.js      linguist-documentation
tools/preview-tabs.css     linguist-documentation

# Binaries: the DFU packages the app ships and the web fonts the page uses.
*.zip   binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
